## The Edge in Extreme Probability Events

Markets priced above 95 or below 5 cents present a structural challenge for most participants. The expected value of betting with the consensus is minimal, while the expected value of betting against requires genuine edge to justify the near-certain loss. This is precisely where tracking verified top performers provides asymmetric value. If three of the top ten traders by PnL are quietly accumulating No shares in a 99-cent market, that pattern suggests they have identified something the crowd is missing.

The Russia-Ukraine diplomatic deadline market will resolve within eight days. By then, the price will have collapsed to zero or one. But the positioning patterns visible now, who is buying, at what size, and with what historical accuracy, offer a lens into how sophisticated capital navigates geopolitical uncertainty. Whether you are looking to trade the market directly or simply to understand how prediction markets aggregate distributed information, watching where the smart money flows remains the most reliable signal available.

